---
import HairlinePlate from "./HairlinePlate.astro";
---
<section class="section blast" id="blast-radius" aria-labelledby="blast-heading">
  <div class="shell blast-grid">
    <div class="blast-copy">
      <p class="fig-label">Fig. 05 · Blast radius</p>
      <h2 id="blast-heading" class="section-title" data-reveal>
        One severance. <em>Every lease on the permit.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lede" data-reveal>
        A surface-commingling permit ties leases to one tank battery. When the
        Commission severs any co-member, every lease on that permit is shut in
        with it, including the ones you operate. LettersIQ maps each P-17 you're
        on and watches the co-members you don't.
      </p>
      <dl class="blast-key" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <dt>Rises with it</dt>
          <dd>Leases piped to the shared battery, on the same P-17</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Stands alone</dt>
          <dd>Leases with their own tank, outside the permit</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Read-out</dt>
          <dd>Lease number · how many leases one order would shut in</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="blast-plate" data-reveal>
      <HairlinePlate
        name="permit"
        tag="Fig. 05 · Lease plat"
        rest="point at a lease"
        label="An isometric lease plat: eight tracts with wellheads, three of them piped to one shared tank battery on a single commingling permit."
        caption="Three tracts pipe to one battery under one permit. Point at any lease to see what a single severance would reach."
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
